name: ['Air-Cult Elemental', 'Alaundo the Seer', 'Altar of Bhaal // Bone Offering', "Ambition's Cost", 'Ambitious Dragonborn', 'Ancient Brass Dragon', 'Ancient Bronze Dragon', 'Ancient Copper Dragon', 'Ancient Gold Dragon', 'Ancient Silver Dragon', 'Arcane Archery', 'Archivist of Oghma', 'Armor of Shadows', 'Ascend from Avernus', 'Astarion, the Decadent', 'Baba Lysaga, Night Witch', 'Bag of Holding', "Baldur's Gate", 'Baleful Beholder', 'Band Together', 'Basilisk Collar', 'Battle Cry Goblin', 'Belt of Giant Strength', 'Black Dragon', 'Black Market Connections', "Blessed Hippogriff // Tyr's Blessing", 'Blood Money', 'Blur', 'Boareskyr Tollkeeper', 'Bonecaller Cleric', 'Breath Weapon', 'Bronze Walrus', 'Calim, Djinn Emperor', 'Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind', 'Cast Down', 'Catti-brie of Mithral Hall', 'Celestial Unicorn', 'Chain Devil', 'Champions of Tyr', 'Chaos Balor', 'Chardalyn Dragon', 'Charmed Sleep', 'Choose Your Weapon', 'Circle of the Land Druid', 'Circle of the Moon Druid', 'Clever Conjurer', 'Cloak of the Bat', 'Contact Other Plane', 'Craving of Yeenoghu', 'Dawnbringer Cleric', 'Deadly Dispute', "Demogorgon's Clutches", 'Devoted Paladin', 'Displacer Kitten', 'Draconic Lore', 'Draconic Muralists', "Dragon's Fire", 'Dragonborn Immolator', 'Dragonborn Looter', 'Dread Linnorm // Scale Deflection', 'Dream Fracture', 'Drider', 'Druid of the Emerald Grove', 'Druidic Ritual', 'Dueling Rapier', 'Earth-Cult Elemental', 'Earthquake Dragon', 'Eldritch Pact', 'Emerald Dragon // Dissonant Wave', 'Ettercap // Web Shot', 'Eyes of the Beholder', "Farideh's Fireball", 'Favored Enemy', 'Fiendlash', 'Flames of Moradin', 'Flaming Fist Duskguard', 'Flaming Fist Officer', 'Follow the Tracks', 'Forest', 'Fraying Line', "Gale's Redirection", 'Gate of the Black Dragon', 'Gate to Manorborn', 'Gate to Seatower', 'Gate to Tumbledown', 'Gate to the Citadel', 'Genasi Rabble-Rouser', 'Ghost Lantern // Bind Spirit', 'Giant Fire Beetles', 'Gnoll Hunter', 'Gnoll Hunting Party', 'Goblin Trapfinder', 'Goggles of Night', 'Gorion, Wise Mentor', 'Grave Choice', 'Gray Slaad // Entropic Decay', 'Grim Bounty', 'Grim Hireling', 'Grim Wanderer', 'Guardian Naga // Banishing Coils', 'Guiding Bolt', 'Guild Thief', 'Guildsworn Prowler', 'Hill Giant Herdgorger', 'Hoard Robber', 'Hobgoblin Captain', 'Hook Horror', "Horn of Valhalla // Ysgard's Call", 'Hypnotic Pattern', 'Icewind Stalwart', 'Illithid Harvester // Plant Tadpoles', 'Improvised Weaponry', 'Incessant Provocation', 'Inspiring Bard', 'Intellect Devourer', "Irenicus's Vile Duplication", 'Iron Golem', 'Island', 'Jade Orb of Dragonkind', 'Jaded Sell-Sword', 'Jan Jansen, Chaos Crafter', 'Jon Irenicus, the Exile', 'Juvenile Mist Dragon', 'Kagha, Shadow Archdruid', 'Kalain, Reclusive Painter', 'Kardum, Patron of Flames', 'Kenku Artificer', 'Kindred Discovery', 'Klement, Novice Acolyte', 'Kobold Warcaller', 'Korlessa, Scale Singer', "Krydle of Baldur's Gate", "Lae'zel's Acrobatics", 'Lantern of Revealing', 'Lapis Orb of Dragonkind', 'Liara of the Flaming Fist', 'Lizardfolk Librarians', "Lozhan, Dragons' Legacy", 'Lurking Roper', 'Mace of Disruption', 'Manticore', 'Mazzy, Truesword Paladin', "Mephit's Enthusiasm", 'Meteor Golem', 'Miirym, Sentinel Wyrm', 'Mind Spike', 'Minimus Containment', 'Minsc & Boo, Timeless Heroes', 'Minthara of the Absolute', 'Mirror of Life Trapping', 'Monk of the Open Hand', 'Monster Manual // Zoological Study', "Moradin's Disciples", 'Mountain', 'Nalfeshnee', "Nalia de'Arnise", 'Navigation Orb', 'Neera, Wild Mage', 'Nefarious Imp', 'Oji, the Exquisite Blade', 'Owlbear', 'Owlbear Shepherd', 'Oyaminartok, Polar Werebear', 'Pact Weapon', "Patriar's Humiliation", 'Pegasus Guardian // Rescue the Foal', "Pilgrim's Eye", 'Plains', 'Poison the Blade', 'Portable Hole', 'Priest of Ancient Lore', 'Prophetic Prism', 'Prosper, Tome-Bound', 'Prosperous Innkeeper', 'Pseudodragon Familiar', 'Raggadragga, Goreguts Boss', 'Rally Maneuver', 'Ranger Squadron', 'Raphael, Fiendish Savior', 'Ray of Frost', 'Reckless Barbarian', 'Red Dragon', 'Rescuer Chwinga', 'Rimeshield Frost Giant', 'Robe of the Archmagi', 'Scaled Nurturer', 'Scouting Hawk', 'Seatower Imprisonment', 'Seek New Knowledge', 'Sepulcher Ghoul', 'Sewer Plague', 'Shambling Ghast', 'Shocking Grasp', 'Sigil of Myrkul', 'Signature Spells', 'Skullport Merchant', 'Snowborn Simulacra', 'Soldiers of the Watch', 'Soulknife Spy', 'Spiked Pit Trap', 'Split the Spoils', 'Steadfast Paladin', 'Steadfast Unicorn', 'Stick Together', "Storm King's Thunder", 'Stroke of Luck', 'Summon Undead', "Sune's Intervention", 'Swamp', 'Swashbuckler Extraordinaire', 'Sword Coast Serpent // Capsizing Wave', 'Sworn to the Legion', 'Sylvan Shepherd', 'Tasha, Unholy Archmage', 'Thayan Evokers', 'The Hourglass Coven', "Thieves' Tools", 'Thrakkus the Butcher', 'Tiefling Outcasts', 'Traverse the Outlands', 'Trelasarra, Moon Dancer', 'Two-Handed Axe // Sweeping Cleave', "Tymora's Invoker", 'Ulder Ravengard, Marshal', 'Undercellar Myconid', 'Underdark Basilisk', 'Undersimplify', 'Unexpected Allies', 'Unexpected Windfall', 'Uthgardt Fury', 'Valiant Farewell', 'Valor Singer', 'Vampire Spawn', 'Verdant Rejuvenation', 'Vladimir and Godfrey', 'Wand of Orcus', 'Warriors of Tiamat', 'Water Weird', 'Wild Shape', 'Wizened Githzerai', 'Wrathful Red Dragon', 'You Come to a River', 'You Come to the Gnoll Camp', 'You Find Some Prisoners', "You Find the Villains' Lair", 'You Hear Something on Watch', 'You Line Up the Shot', 'You Meet in a Tavern', "You're Ambushed on the Road", "You're Confronted by Robbers", 'Young Blue Dragon // Sand Augury', 'Young Red Dragon // Bathe in Gold', 'Yuan-Ti Scaleshield']
